{"id":"3996ce2fa4b5ae59","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph.md","title":"截断减法的有界算术图","display":"df-truncated-subtraction-graph — 截断减法的有界算术图","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph","aliases":["72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph"],"display":"df-truncated-subtraction-graph — 截断减法的有界算术图","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]"],"chapter":"II","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II §1.2.8(a), print89/PDF101","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truncated-subtraction-graph — 截断减法的有界算术图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"II"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II §1.2.8(a), print89/PDF101"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span> 为互异的数变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\\)</span> 含 0,S,+,·,≤。下式是旧语言公式，不引入一个已经存在的减法函数符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubGraph}(x,y,z):=((y+z=x)\\lor(x\\le y\\land z=0)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubGraph}(x,y,z):=((y+z=x)\\lor(x\\le y\\land z=0)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 §1.2.8(a) 的 M(x,y,z)。当 x≤y 时输出0；当 y&lt;x 时 y+z=x。两分支在 x=y、z=0 处重合且相容，不能错误要求它们在语法上互斥。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x,y,z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubGraph}(x,y,z):=((y+z=x)\\lor(x\\le y\\land z=0)).","display":true}],"bytes":1181,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[